  2121	This appendix gives a self-contained proof of Lemma~\ref{lem:85}. It does not use Lee--Venkatesan's Lemma~8.5,
  2122	neither its statement nor its proof. It also does not use Harper's preprint \cite{harper2012} directly.
  2123	\begin{itemize}
