  2125	  \emph{exactly} the error modulo $s$ divided by $\ell-1$ (Lemma~\ref{lem:E2}). So we need a restricted Bombieri--Vinogradov estimate over
  2126	  smooth moduli with a relative saving, which we prove as Lemma~\ref{lem:SM}.
  2127	\item Characters of large conductor are handled by the classical multiplicative large sieve and a Perron bound (Lemma~\ref{lem:LS}).
  2128	\item Characters of small conductor are handled by one published lemma of Drappeau (Fact~\ref{fact:D}).
