  2134	consists of a reference to the computations of \S3.3 of Harper's preprint \cite{harper2012}, which has not been published. Drappeau
  2135	writes ``il d\'ecoule des calculs de la section~3.3 de [Har12b]''. Our argument never enters the preprint, but the preprint stands
