   504	Bret\`eche--Tenenbaum's local bound, and the multiplicative large sieve) are stated in Appendix~\ref{app:85}. The number-field inputs (Lagarias--Odlyzko, Stark,
   505	Landau) are stated in Section~\ref{sec:lv6}.
